WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.363 align:middle line:90%

2
00:00:00.363 --> 00:00:03.030 align:middle line:84%
I have some projects that belong
to different groups on my team,

3
00:00:03.030 --> 00:00:04.740 align:middle line:90%
like our Finance Department.

4
00:00:04.740 --> 00:00:07.275 align:middle line:84%
While there's not a way to
create subprojects in Basecamp,

5
00:00:07.275 --> 00:00:09.150 align:middle line:84%
there's a friendly
workaround so I can set up

6
00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:11.310 align:middle line:90%
my projects like that.

7
00:00:11.310 --> 00:00:14.310 align:middle line:84%
Let's click on the All People
tab and add a new company.

8
00:00:14.310 --> 00:00:16.980 align:middle line:84%
I'll name it "Finance" since
I have some projects for them.

9
00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:20.160 align:middle line:84%
The important part is to not
add any users to this company.

10
00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:22.710 align:middle line:84%
Now, to move this
project under Finance,

11
00:00:22.710 --> 00:00:26.220 align:middle line:84%
I'll open it and click on the
People and Permissions tab.

12
00:00:26.220 --> 00:00:29.700 align:middle line:84%
Then click this link to
add people to the project.

13
00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:33.390 align:middle line:84%
I'll choose the finance company
we just created and click Add.

14
00:00:33.390 --> 00:00:35.640 align:middle line:84%
This adds that fake
company to the project.

15
00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:38.410 align:middle line:90%

16
00:00:38.410 --> 00:00:40.860 align:middle line:84%
Then click on the Project
Settings link here.

17
00:00:40.860 --> 00:00:43.860 align:middle line:84%
Scroll down to this
Primary Company section.

18
00:00:43.860 --> 00:00:49.510 align:middle line:84%
We'll select Finance from this
dropdown menu, then click Save.

19
00:00:49.510 --> 00:00:52.540 align:middle line:84%
After that's done, we can go
back to the Global dashboard

20
00:00:52.540 --> 00:00:55.660 align:middle line:84%
and see our projects under
the new finance company.

21
00:00:55.660 --> 00:00:58.510 align:middle line:84%
Using this method lets you group
your projects under an umbrella

22
00:00:58.510 --> 00:01:02.310 align:middle line:84%
label and access them
easily in one location.
